abstract: "Computational supplement for a conditional static scalar gravitational-response analysis, including spectral normalization, boundary detuning, hyperbolic horoball geometry, and published inverse-power coefficient conversions. The release contains three suites totaling 529 numerical checks and nine separate regression tests. No experimental data are fitted."
